        "Some of your clients come back on a rhythm: every two weeks for a trim, every month for a check-up.",
        "Recurring bookings let you set that rhythm once. Pick the service, the gap and the end date, and every visit is held on your calendar and in their reminders.",
        "It works on every plan and takes about a minute the first time."
